{"id":"n59571-1-8","stage":3,"title":"복수 · 复仇","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59571-1-8-1","ko":"승규야, 지수를 왜 때렸니?","zh":"承奎，你为什么打智秀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}},{"text":"지수를","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지수를","audio":"/audio/e9f75725b9488ce72144.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수를","audio":"/audio/e9f75725b9488ce72144.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"때렸니?","meaning":"打，揍，抽","explanation":"때리다：打，揍，抽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"때리다","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14433","senseId":"1","lemma":"때리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때렸니","audio":"/audio/822b71095f80f91413f2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"97474f90b9c0f4d7","term":"때리다","zh":"打，揍，抽","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3","entryId":"14433","definition":"用手或手中的东西狠狠地打击。","pronunciation":["때리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c080480d43304bcd7ae0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59571-1-8-2","ko":"지수가 먼저 저를 때려서 복수를 한 것뿐이에요.","zh":"是智秀先打我的，我只是报复而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先。","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}},{"text":"저를","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저를","audio":"/audio/da4de346f30de5013b78.mp3"}},{"text":"때려서","meaning":"打，揍，抽","explanation":"때리다：打，揍，抽；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"때리다","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14433","senseId":"1","lemma":"때리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때려서","audio":"/audio/f60ac5ba32159e36139e.mp3"}},{"text":"복수를","meaning":"复仇","explanation":"복수：复仇；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"복수","audio":"/audio/cc1a8e3813f8c5eb7458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59571","senseId":"1","lemma":"복수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"복수를","audio":"/audio/6635dc0d2b255a1092c4.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"것뿐이에요.","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；뿐：限定范围，表示“只有、仅仅”；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것뿐이에요","audio":"/audio/57a94859aa2ba1ae8960.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"